  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: "Your body is covered in bony plates. Your plates are medium armor
    in the plate armor group that grant a +4 item bonus to AC, a Dex cap of +1, a
    check penalty of \u20132, a Speed penalty of \u20135 feet, a Strength value of
    +3, and have the aquadynamic and comfort traits. You can never wear other armor
    or remove your plates. You can etch armor runes onto your plates."
